-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Where the code in this repository came from
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This library is the common base of a family of sibling projects: emorphed,
ensqsqed, eosed, kwsed, nanosyned, p2ked, rxved, s3ked and x5ded. Each of
those grew its own copy of the same handful of modules -- the settings cache,
the favourites database, bank listing, dump framing, MIDI port discovery --
and each copy then drifted a little. What is here is the common version of
that code, kept in step across the family rather than copied nine times.

The code is a GPL-2.0-or-later derivative of the sibling projects, which are
all GPL-2.0-or-later themselves and carry copyright notices of the form
"Copyright (C) 2026 <project> contributors". Those notices are preserved in
the file headers of the files that came from them, and the aggregate list of
contributors is reproduced below.

  Copyright (C) 2026  emorphed contributors
  Copyright (C) 2026  ensqsqed contributors
  Copyright (C) 2026  eosed contributors
  Copyright (C) 2026  kwsed contributors
  Copyright (C) 2026  nanosyned contributors
  Copyright (C) 2026  p2ked contributors
  Copyright (C) 2026  rxved contributors
  Copyright (C) 2026  s3ked contributors
  Copyright (C) 2026  x5ded contributors

